Source: emaj
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/dalibo/emaj

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-emaj
Architecture: all
Provides: postgresql-emaj
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${perl:Depends}, libdbi-perl, libdbd-pg-perl
Description: table change logging and rollback for PostgreSQL
 E-Maj records table changes through triggers and can inspect or roll them back
 to named marks. It also includes statistics, monitoring, and parallel rollback
 client tools.
